<title>USA: Hungarian Telephone Q1 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Hungarian Telephone Q1 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First fiscal quarter ended March 31,</p>
<p>						  1997		  1996</p>
<p> Net Revenues			  $7,924,000	  $5,159,000</p>
<p> Net Loss				 6,948,000  loss   5,768,000</p>
<p> Net loss per common share		 1.66  loss	1.41</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>   Common shares outstanding	4,185,317	   4,080,079</p>
<p>NOTE - Hungarian Telephone and Cable Corp provides telephone services in five regions of Hungary.</p>
